{"title":"Poetic Textural Landscapes by Lee Hyun-Joung","link":"https://kottke.org/25/11/poetic-textural-landscapes-by-lee-hyun-joung","date":1764018325000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lee-hyun-joung-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lee-hyun-joung-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lee-hyun-joung-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1716\" alt=\"mountain-like landscape drawing\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lee-hyun-joung-04.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lee-hyun-joung-04.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lee-hyun-joung-04.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1625\" alt=\"black and white swirling lines\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lee-hyun-joung-05.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lee-hyun-joung-05.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lee-hyun-joung-05.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"718\" alt=\"mountain-like landscape drawing\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lee-hyun-joung-06.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lee-hyun-joung-06.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lee-hyun-joung-06.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1625\" alt=\"mountain-like landscape drawing\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lee-hyun-joung-07.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lee-hyun-joung-07.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/lee-hyun-joung-07.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1625\" alt=\"black and white swirling lines\" /></p>\n\n<p>I’ve posted about Korean artist <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lee_hyunjoung/\">Lee Hyun-Joung</a>’s swirling and swooping work <a href=\"https://kottke.org/22/03/ridgelines-in-relief\">before</a>, but I recently saw one of her pieces in person and decided to feature some of her most recent stuff. It’s always a good time to look at art.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Lee%20Hyun-Joung\">Lee Hyun-Joung</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/11/poetic-textural-landscapes-by-lee-hyun-joung\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"cf3c80173344ca0961e61ab9f4172adfaf5556d474c29208251867e94884dfaf","category":"Sites"}